  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Cut onion and garlic into small pieces.",
    "In a bamboo-tray, combine chestnuts, olive oil, onion, garlic, cinnamon, cumin, coriander, salt, and pepper. Toss to coat.",
    "Roast in the oven for 20 minutes.",
    "Add date syrup and cure to the tray. Toss to coat.",
    "Return to oven and roast for an additional 15 minutes.",
    "Remove from oven and let cool slightly.",
    "Chop parsley and sprinkle on top.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy."
